# Keep the working tree at LF on every platform.
#
# Git's autocrlf would otherwise hand out CRLF on Windows, and JavaScript's `.` does not match
# \r — so every source-scanning regex anchored with $ stops matching, silently. The l10n check
# reported all 136 strings missing before this was pinned down.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.xpi binary
